# システム環境設定's pages opened by the 固有データ of an applist entry, and its 写し
# (docs/tessronos 11.3, 11.6), for tools/x64/ui_run64.py with the image of make TARGET=_X64_
# DESKTOP=1 UITEST=1 sdimg a KTEST=1 build. "openapp UUID APPLIST" opens the
# object as a link of a program's window opens it, carrying the link's applist; "openput" opens
# what the last 写しを作る put in the first window. The window is at 160,80; its menu opens at
# 400,300 with 操作 under the pointer, 写しを作る the third line of 操作.
#
# a link to the program object with data: the page it names
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42 {"tessronos-sysenv":{"name":"システム環境設定","data":"colour"}}
expect sysenv: opened with data "colour"
expect sysenv: page "colour"
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
shot sp_colour
nwin システム環境設定
want ok 1
# open already: the same window, on the page asked now
logmark
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42 {"tessronos-sysenv":{"data":"screen"}}
expectsince sysenv: page "screen"
expectsince sysenv: screen page
wait 500
shot sp_screen
nwin システム環境設定
want ok 1
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42 {"tessronos-sysenv":{"data":"keyboard"}}
expectsince sysenv: page "keyboard"
# what it does not know changes nothing: a long one comes whole, and is not a page
logmark
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42 {"tessronos-sysenv":{"data":"no-such-page"}}
expectsince sysenv: opened with data "no-such-page"
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42 {"tessronos-sysenv":{"data":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"}}
expectsince sysenv: opened with data "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
wait 300
absent sysenv: page "no-such-page"
# the screen's device object: its applist opens the screen's page
logmark
open 01a0d680-3aa9-7d84-936e-21fa0c57b84d
expectsince sysenv: page "screen"
wait 300
nwin システム環境設定
want ok 1
# 写しを作る of 〈配色〉
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42 {"tessronos-sysenv":{"data":"colour"}}
expectsince sysenv: page "colour"
wait 500
click 400 300 1
wait 500
shot sp_menu
move 405 341
wait 150
move 440 341
wait 150
move 470 341
wait 300
shot sp_menu_op
move 495 375
wait 150
click 495 375
expect sysenv: copy of "colour" made, 1 lines (0)
expect desktop: link put "システム環境設定（配色）の写し"
wait 800
shot sp_made
# another scheme chosen, so that the copy differs from what is set
logmark
click 300 201
expectsince sysenv: scheme
wait 800
# the copy opened: its values shown, 取り消し puts the parts back and sets nothing
logmark
openput
expectsince sysenv: copy of "colour" opened, 1 lines, 1 differ, 0 left out
wait 800
shot sp_copy_ask
click 650 452
expectsince sysenv: copy of "colour" put back
wait 500
shot sp_copy_back
# opened again, and 設定: the copy's scheme set as the page sets it
logmark
openput
expectsince sysenv: copy of "colour" opened, 1 lines, 1 differ, 0 left out
wait 800
click 775 452
expectsince sysenv: scheme
expectsince sysenv: copy of "colour" set
wait 500
shot sp_copy_set
nwin システム環境設定
want ok 1
absent !OACV!
